# The macro sources are committed byte for byte.
#
# The build merges them into ONE .cs file, and the merged file has to come
# out identical on every computer - the package ships the merged file, and
# the source tree must be able to rebuild exactly it.  A line-ending
# conversion between the commit and the working copy would change the
# merged output, so these files are marked as "not text" and are never
# touched by the line-ending conversion.
source/*.cs        -text
source/*.ps1       -text
install.ps1        -text
install.cmd        -text
